    lines=['# Stage3B — compact real-survey benchmark,1029','','The benchmark uses genuinely independent recovered Legacy supervision and a newly reserved COSMOS spectroscopic confirmation cohort. All20 compact numerical fits and source-only checkpoint selection completed before opening T2 redshifts. The source-learning gate passed. Results are conditional on the fixed5000-update budget; final source convergence is assessed separately.','','## Independent source transfer','','| Direction/model | N | Outliers | NMAD | CE | CRPS |68% coverage |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
    for r in source:lines.append('|'+r['condition']+'|'+r['n']+'|'+'|'.join(fmt(r[k]) for k in ['outlier_fraction','nmad','ce','crps','coverage_68'])+'|')
    lines+=['','E1 and E2 exclude every identity shared with the other survey. They contain14,894 independent Legacy validation galaxies and5,351 independent HSC validation galaxies. Old source-test objects and ambiguous matches are excluded; COSMOS is spatially isolated from all source training and modelselection. S3 actual paired observations remain a separate source-validation diagnostic.','','## Independent target confirmation','','T2 eligibility: '+json.dumps(elig)+'. References outside0<z<=4.5 and insufficient full-band observations are counted, never clipped. All models compare identical eligible objects. Restricted-band failures produce the registered uniform PDF for numerical/physical models; counts remain in the tables. Qwen retains its original missing-value interface.','','| Mixed-source configuration | N | Outliers | NMAD | CE | CRPS |68% coverage |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
