    lines+=['',f'Both-seed registered outlier success criterion: {success}. This criterion does not supersede PDF calibration, control comparisons, source convergence or population selection. Bootstrap resamples unique galaxies jointly; training-seed variability is reported separately in training_seed_variability.csv. Two seeds do not determine a precise distribution over training randomness.','','Capacity/information-control paired differences R2 minus comparator:','']
